    {
      "title": "Real-time Chatbot Romance Scam Detection in Stage Classification",
      "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.20631",
      "description": "arXiv:2610.20631v1 Announce Type: cross \nAbstract: Romance scam has become a serious problem via social media, and the improvement of artificial intelligence enable to fake identify easily. In the study, a chatbot has developed to detect romance scam in real-time through Line Messaging API. Using the seven stage theories in the social science field, the stages of romance scam can be detected through large language model. In addition, once a romance scam is detected, the chatbot provides explanations of the stage and prevention advices through large language model. The contribution of the work provides a practical application, and can be used in real scenario for reducing the risk of romance scam.",
      "source_name": "arXiv AI",
      "published": "2026-10-16T04:00:00"
    }
  ]
